    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39287" root="نتح" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُتُوحٌ</span></b>  The <i>gums</i> of trees: (S, K:) one should
not say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُتُوعٌ</span>, (S,) as is commonly said: (TA:)
it is doubtful whether its sing. be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَتْحٌ</span>, or of
some other form. (MF.)

